{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262YZk67UFih1794901954.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中國駐日使館提醒中國公民，切勿在日本富士山封山期擅自登山。</p><p></p><p>近日一名中國男遊客在富士山全面進入封山期後，違規攀登途中失去聯絡，至今仍未尋回。</p><p></p><p>中國駐日本大使館周二發文，指富士山等山地在封山期間暴風雪頻發，山中休憩所及急救中心等設施全部停業，提醒在日中國公民在封山期擅自登山，以免發生危險。</p><p></p><p>富士山每年除7至9月初登山季外，其餘時間均是封山期。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T08:30:51.805530+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T07:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T09:04:51.313597+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T08:24:13.506230+00:00","content_hash":"196bc2ec69d969b6e396f40fecceeed99f92fb19f782e9e5e484d14801b1f13e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}